'''Jal-MejJak''' are [[volcanic creatures]] that appear in the [[Inferno]] when [[TzKal-Zuk]] is at 20% health. They will heal TzKal-Zuk for 15-24 hitpoints every three ticks, until the player attacks them. Doing so causes them to stop healing TzKal-Zuk and start raining lava balls on the ground in front of them, similar to the effect at the [[Chaos Temple (Wilderness)|Chaos Temple]]. Each lava ball does 5-10 damage. This damage can potentially be dodged, but doing so risks being hit by TzKal-Zuk, who can kill the player instantly. Thus, the preferred method is to kill them quickly with [[ranged]] or [[magic]], while eating through the damage.

